  "deletedAt": null,
  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "The new OSC camera endpoints only give world-space position info, and can only be set to world-space coordinates. This makes the new camera controls unusable for livestreamed content, as it cannot follow the player around the world consistently.\n\nWhile receiving is less of a concern, setting is.\n\nWe also cannot set the anchor mode from OSC, which means that this cannot be controlled either.",
